# Nightly Obsidian task digest: open TaskNotes tasks scheduled today or
# earlier, emailed with obsidian:// links. No due tasks = no email. Exits 1
# only when the email could not be delivered, so the failure notification
# (banner + ntfy push) covers a lost digest, not mere findings.
JOB_SCHEDULE="0 3 * * *"
JOB_COMMAND="sh \"$ROOT/../local-obsidian-tasks/obsidian-tasks.sh\" run"
